@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@webOrigin = http://localhost:5173
@projectId = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_PROJECT_UUID
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_CHAINOPS_ACCESS_COOKIE_VALUE_AFTER_LOGIN
@monitoredContractId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_MONITOR_UUID
@csrfToken = REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_RESPONSE_TOKEN

### Obtain CSRF token (keep cookies enabled).
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf

### Login with a verified account; use local variables for actual credentials.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Origin: {{webOrigin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"YOUR_VERIFIED_EMAIL","password":"YOUR_PASSWORD"}

### Copy chainops_access from the login response cookie into accessToken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitored-contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Vault Contract","network":"sepolia","address":"0x0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567"}

### Read the persisted target.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/monitored-contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Store the target's id in monitoredContractId before this request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Large Withdrawal","monitoredContractId":"{{monitoredContractId}}","eventName":"Withdrawal","condition":{"field":"amount","operator":"gt","value":"100"},"enabled":true}

### Read the persisted rule; follow the README's Neon SELECT verification.
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
